(Stuart:)Really, I can move.

4
00:00:13,994 --> 00:00:15,874
(Bernadette:)Not just Leonard and
Penny's love, but the love

5
00:00:15,879 --> 00:00:18,159
(Bernadette:)we have for them,
as well as each other.

6
00:00:18,165 --> 00:00:22,505
(Sheldon:)Speaking of love, STDs among
the elderly are skyrocketing.

7
